# `minio/mint` is archived and its `edge` tag is a moving target, so s3s runs
# the suite from an image it controls: s3s-project/mint builds the archived mint
# with the SDK revisions pinned and fixes the client-side test defects the image
# used to fail on: the conditional copy in minio-js reads a field the SDK does
# not return, and minio-js, minio-java and aws-sdk-ruby put an unsigned
# `x-amz-acl` on a presigned PUT, which AWS and s3s refuse - plus a fix for the
# mc download host that no longer exists. The image is amd64 only. Override
# `MINT_IMAGE_REF` to test another build.
MINT_IMAGE_REF="${MINT_IMAGE_REF:-ghcr.io/s3s-project/mint:202610040924@sha256:a90f9cd5701d4fa5b1f297809321155103043a1b9cec183492bde4ad39cdbf61}"
